                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1f7372ef-730c-4b9a-ab07-820950146eb4",
                                "sense_id": "06aaaa4a-e9ec-3a89-b9d5-3c44e11ef633",
                                "text": "Wimples, colfs, cascanets, carkenels, fusles, frislets, palisadoes, who cares about them any more?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "33e22c0b-6812-40ad-9269-bf11ab4f3a65",
                                "sense_id": "06aaaa4a-e9ec-3a89-b9d5-3c44e11ef633",
                                "text": "In this medley of things we shall see purles, falles, […] parlets, frislets, fillets, […] and whalebone wheels—Eve!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cb7cf2df-920a-422a-aeaf-885334f992a2",
                                "sense_id": "06aaaa4a-e9ec-3a89-b9d5-3c44e11ef633",
                                "text": "For it is shame enough to 've thought to make\n A frislet of their own shake like the locks\n Of cloud-hared Zeus."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "94cad0f0-5118-4679-af03-b77a1d40f737",
                                "sense_id": "06aaaa4a-e9ec-3a89-b9d5-3c44e11ef633",
                                "text": "such stir with sticks and combs […] partlets, frislets, bandlets, […] and so many lets, that yet she is scarce drest to the girdle."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4531cf7d-f8ce-4c4c-8e17-1c6c21a7c5e8",
                                "sense_id": "06aaaa4a-e9ec-3a89-b9d5-3c44e11ef633",
                                "text": "Unfamiliar words abound, including many intriguing professional roles --ippers, woadmongers, cordwainers--and objects--perukes, frislets (small ruffles) and spangles."
                            }
                        ]
